  - name: "P.P.E. Channeling"
    description: "Turns P.P.E. into other kinds of energy. Makes simple hand-held electronics (flashlight, radio, video camera, portable computer, translator, shaver) run just by holding them, at no cost. Recharges: one small S.D.C. battery per level for 1 P.P.E. in total; a car-sized S.D.C. battery for 2; a standard E-Clip for 12; a long E-Clip for 18; an energy canister or rail gun for 30; one blast of a high-powered energy cannon (1D6x10 to 2D6x10 M.D.; two blasts if it does 6D6 to 1D4x10 M.D.) for 30; a P.P.E. clip for 60."
  - name: "Fire Energy Bolts"
