  - name: "Steal & Redirect Ley Line Energy"
    description: "Blocks other people from drawing ley line energy along 50 feet (15.2 m) of the line per level. At a time of power or during a ritual, can take 1D6x10% of the P.P.E. being called up by others into himself instead. He must know who is drawing, see them and be within 200 feet (61 m). Stolen energy lasts ten minutes per level, and anything over his normal capacity then bleeds away harmlessly. Draws twice the usual P.P.E. at ley lines and nexus points."
  - name: "Impervious to Energy"
    description: "Takes no damage from lasers, ion blasts, particle beams, plasma, electricity, fire, heat and radiation. Magical energy and Ley Line Storms do half damage. Rune and most magic weapons, and all kinetic attacks (blades, clubs, bullets, arrows, Vibro-Blades, falls, punches, thrown objects), do full damage."
  - name: "Ley Line Walker Abilities"
    description: "Senses ley lines and magic energy, and has Ley Line Phasing and Ley Line Rejuvenation, all as the Ley Line Walker (Rifts Ultimate Edition p.113)."
  - name: "Connection to their Squire"
    description: "After a year of working together (six months if already friends) Knight and Squire feel when the other is in serious danger, read each other''s moods, and know when the partner is lying or something is wrong. The Knight has a rough idea where the Squire is, and picks the right direction, room or vehicle 01-90% of the time. Range 10 miles (16 km). No P.P.E. or I.S.P. cost; always on."
