    +10% bonuses.
  - Horsemanship: Equestrian (Knight) is stored as the RUE row Horsemanship:
    Equestrian; the "(Knight)" gloss names no separate Rifts skill.
  - The seven intuitive spells are granted by name; the book''s "Fists of Fury"
    is the catalog''s Fist of Fury. Two more spells from levels 1-6 at each
    level after the first are stored as spells_per_level 2.
  - The psionic schedule is exact: three Sensitive/Physical picks at level one,
    one more per level from two, plus a Super pick at four and at nine.
  - The O.C.C. bonuses, the psionics and the magic are stored. The 1D4 to P.S.
    and 1D6+10 to Spd are dice and are rolled once.
  - occ_group is magic: printed 28 files the Mystic Knight among the magic
    O.C.C.s. The class states no S.D.C. base beyond the +20 bonus, so it
    needs a CORE_SDC_BY_CLASS entry, 1D6 as a non-man-of-arms.
  - Starting money stores the 1D6x100 credits. The 2D6x1000 in precious
    metals, gems and artifacts is barter goods and stays in the body.
  - Not in equipment_starting, left to the body: a player-chosen magic sword, three
    ancient weapons, a weapon per W.P. with 1D6+6 E-Clips each, body armor,
    and the M.D.C. barding. The TW Barrier Shield and the White Rose kit are
    stored: two petals (the book gives two per level), two thorns and two
    healing potions. Three weeks of rations is one
    food-rations entry and 50 feet of strong cord/rope is one cord entry.
  - Language: American and Literacy: American are stored as one pick from the
    repeatable Language: Other / Literacy: Other rows with the printed bonus,
    so the player names the language American. The catalog has no row for
    either, and a stub would be a wrong zero-percent row.
  - Experience table: printed 79, "Knight of the White Rose & Keeper of the
    Garden", shared with the Keeper of the Garden.
